, "text": "weather", "start": 94.752, "end": 95.032}, {"i": 266, "text": "holds", "start": 95.112, "end": 95.413}, {"i": 267, "text": "through", "start": 95.473, "end": 95.693}, {"i": 268, "text": "the", "start": 95.713, "end": 95.793}, {"i": 269, "text": "weekend?", "start": 95.813, "end": 96.274}, {"i": 270, "text": "The", "start": 96.454, "end": 96.555}, {"i": 271, "text": "forecast", "start": 96.575, "end": 97.216}, {"i": 272, "text": "says", "start": 97.256, "end": 97.396}, {"i": 273, "text": "it", "start": 97.436, "end": 97.496}, {"i": 274, "text": "clears", "start": 97.536, "end": 97.816}, {"i": 275, "text": "by", "start": 97.877, "end": 97.997}, {"i": 276, "text": "Saturday.", "start": 98.057, "end": 98.497}, {"i": 277, "text": "Take", "start": 99.379, "end": 99.559}, {"i": 278, "text": "care,", "start": 99.599, "end": 99.779}, {"i": 279, "text": "Jens.", "start": 99.799, "end": 100.08}], "segments": [{"start": 0.126, "end": 0.766, "text": "Morning, Jens."}, {"start": 1.067, "end": 2.788, "text": "You came through that downpour, I see."}, {"start": 3.328, "end": 3.788, "text": "I did."}, {"start": 4.189, "end": 6.55, "text": "It went sideways the last hundred meters."}, {"start": 6.891, "end": 8.051, "text": "I nearly turned back."}, {"start": 8.612, "end": 9.472, "text": "Glad you did not."}, {"start": 9.933, "end": 10.693, "text": "What brings you in?"}, {"start": 11.213, "end": 13.655, "text": "Some skin changes that keep bothering me."}, {"start": 14.376, "end": 19.639, "text": "One under my right breast, a couple on my stomach, and one on my left lower leg."}, {"start": 20.039, "end": 21.04, "text": "I want them gone."}, {"start": 21.58, "end": 22.301, "text": "Let me look at them."}, {"start": 23.161, "end": 27.144, "text": "The one under your right breast is a skin wart, about one centimeter."}, {"start": 27.725, "end": 29.746, "text": "And you can tell that just by looking at it?"}, {"start": 30.346, "end": 32.127, "text": "Yes, it has the appearance of one."}, {"start": 32.907, "end": 38.331, "text": "The others on your abdomen and lower leg are 0.6 centimeters, scaly and brownish."}, {"start": 38.991, "end": 41.432, "text": "Scaly and brownish covers a lot of ground."}, {"start": 41.813, "end": 42.913, "text": "What do you think they are?"}, {"start": 43.514, "end": 45.675, "text": "They look like seborrheic keratoses."}, {"start": 46.235, "end": 47.996, "text": "That is a common harmless growth."}, {"start": 48.636, "end": 50.758, "text": "Look like, so you are not certain."}, {"start": 51.438, "end": 52.799, "text": "I am describing what I see."}, {"start": 53.399, "end": 56.281, "text": "My assessment is that these are benign skin changes."}, {"start": 56.961, "end": 58.142, "text": "Benign, all of them?"}, {"start": 58.642, "end": 60.323, "text": "Including the one under the breast?"}, {"start": 60.963, "end": 61.224, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 61.544, "end": 63.085, "text": "That is my assessment of all of them."}, {"start": 63.685, "end": 64.265, "text": "Fair enough."}, {"start": 64.666, "end": 66.567, "text": "Then can we get on with removing them?"}, {"start": 67.207, "end": 67.647, "text": "We can."}, {"start": 68.268, "end": 70.089, "text": "I will arrange an appointment for the removal."}, {"start": 70.789, "end": 72.27, "text": "And what am I signing up for?"}, {"start": 72.65, "end": 74.612, "text": "I would rather hear the downside now."}, {"start": 75.312, "end": 79.655, "text": "There will be a scar where each one is removed, and there is a risk of infection afterwards."}, {"start": 80.255, "end": 82.016, "text": "You should know both before we book it."}, {"start": 82.916, "end": 83.197, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 83.537, "end": 85.338, "text": "A scar and an infection risk."}, {"start": 85.758, "end": 88.502, "text": "I would still rather have them off than keep catching them."}, {"start": 89.243, "end": 89.744, "text": "Understood."}, {"start": 90.245, "end": 92.228, "text": "Then the appointment for removal is the plan."}, {"start": 92.849, "end": 93.129, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 93.61, "end": 96.274, "text": "Any idea whether this weather holds through the weekend?"}, {"start": 96.454, "end": 98.497, "text": "The forecast says it clears by Saturday."}, {"start": 99.379, "end": 100.08, "text": "Take care, Jens."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.001}}